WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.877 --> 00:00:04.546
Reporter:
This is a question for you,
Alice.

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:07.174
Reporter:
What made you decide to direct
this film?

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:10.177
♪ When I was a child, running in
the night ♪

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:13.805
♪ Afraid of what might be ♪

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:16.016
I think the only reason to make
a movie is...

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:18.852
...if you can't help it.

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:22.105
♪ Hiding in the dark ♪
♪ Hiding in the street ♪

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:23.649
Alice Ginor, right?

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:26.068
♪And of what was following me♪

00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:28.362
I've been wondering where you
went.

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:31.990
♪♪
(Melodic vocal)

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.867
Alice:
I read the script and uh,

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.535
Alice:
I just didn't have a choice.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:39.206
♪ Now hounds of love hunting me ♪

00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:42.793
Alice:
It was an act of survival for
me.

00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:46.588
♪ I don't know what's good for
me ♪

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:48.173
♪♪
(Melodic vocal)

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:50.676
♪ Oh, here I go ♪

00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:53.804
Alice:
You don't believe anyone who
says you can have it all.

00:00:53.804 --> 00:00:57.766
♪ Don't let me go ♪

00:00:57.766 --> 00:00:59.059
Because you can't.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:02.604
♪ Hold me down! ♪

00:01:02.604 --> 00:01:04.940
Alice:
And sometimes people you love...

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:09.111
♪ It's coming for me through the
trees ♪

00:01:09.111 --> 00:01:11.113
I'm sorry.

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:15.492
♪ Help me, darling ♪
♪ Help me, please ♪

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:17.536
Alice:
Sometimes the people you love
get hurt on the way.

00:01:17.536 --> 00:01:18.537
(Knock knock knock)

00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:20.122
Alice:
I guess it's all part of the
ride.

00:01:20.122 --> 00:01:23.583
♪ Feel your arms surround me ♪

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:27.504
You can pray to God that it will
be worth it, at the end.

00:01:27.504 --> 00:01:30.549
♪ Now hounds of love hunting me ♪

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:32.634
♪♪
(Tense music)

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.012
♪ Don't let me go ♪

00:01:35.012 --> 00:01:36.805
♪♪
(Tense music)

00:01:36.805 --> 00:01:39.057
♪ It's coming for me ♪

00:01:39.057 --> 00:01:41.059
♪♪
(Tense music)

00:01:41.059 --> 00:01:43.103
♪ Help me, someone ♪

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:54.323
♪♪
(Intense musical buildup)

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.575
Do you think it was worth it?

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.870
(Camera shutter clicks)

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:03.081
♪ Hounds of love hunting me ♪

